---
import type { Locale } from "../data/lang";
interface Props { locale: Locale }
const zh = Astro.props.locale === "zh";
const install = "curl -fsSL https://tigris-tv.pages.dev/install.sh | TV=192.168.1.20 bash";
const restore = "curl -fsSL https://tigris-tv.pages.dev/install.sh | TV=192.168.1.20 bash -s -- restore";
---
<div class="quick-install reveal">
  <article class="quick-card">
    <p class="eyebrow">MACOS / LINUX</p>
    <h3>{zh ? "一行命令，装好并验收。" : "One command. Install and verify."}</h3>
    <p>{zh ? "先装好 adb、curl 和 Python 3，将示例 IP 换成电视 IP。脚本保存原桌面记录，并校验安装包。" : "Install adb, curl and Python 3 first. Replace the sample IP. The script records the original home and verifies the APK."}</p>
    <div class="code"><pre><code id="cmd-quick-install">{install}</code></pre><button class="copy" data-copy="#cmd-quick-install" type="button"><span class="label"></span></button></div>
    <p class="fine">{zh ? "Windows 推荐交给能执行命令的电脑版 Agent。默认保留 ADB 设置；电视仍需授权，实体 Home 与待机唤醒需要人工验收。" : "On Windows, use a desktop agent that can execute commands. ADB preferences are preserved by default. TV authorization, physical Home and standby/wake checks require your participation."}</p>
  </article>
  <article class="quick-card">
    <p class="eyebrow">UPDATE / RESTORE</p>
    <h3>{zh ? "升级保留设置，还原有路可走。" : "Keep your settings. Keep a way back."}</h3>
    <p>{zh ? "2.0.4 起：控制中心 → 设置 → 软件更新与投屏。可自动检查桌面和投屏组件的新版本；系统可能仍需你确认安装。" : "From 2.0.4: Control Center → Settings → Software updates & casting. Check both apps automatically; Android may ask you to confirm installation."}</p>
    <details><summary>{zh ? "恢复原桌面" : "Restore the original home"}</summary>
      <p>{zh ? "在原来的电脑上使用原安装记录。默认保留 Tigris，末尾加 --uninstall 才会卸载。" : "Use the original computer and saved installation snapshot. Tigris stays installed unless you append --uninstall."}</p>
      <div class="code"><pre><code id="cmd-quick-restore">{restore}</code></pre><button class="copy" data-copy="#cmd-quick-restore" type="button"><span class="label"></span></button></div>
    </details>
    <a class="text-link" href="/agent.md">{zh ? "完整安装、验收与还原说明" : "Full installation, verification and restore guide"} ↗</a>
  </article>
</div>
